# Retail Store Analytics Dashboard

## Project Overview
The Retail Store Analytics Dashboard is designed to analyze retail business performance across multiple stores, regions, salespersons, and product categories.

The dashboard helps identify revenue trends, profitability, customer purchasing behavior, and store performance to support data-driven business decisions.

## Tools & Technologies
- Power BI
- Power Query
- DAX
- Microsoft Excel

## Key Performance Indicators (KPIs)
- Total Revenue
- Total Profit
- Units Per Transaction (UPT)
- Average Transaction Value (ATV)
- Conversion Rate

## Dashboard Analysis
- Top Performing Salespersons by Revenue
- Store-wise Conversion Rate
- Store Performance Across Regions
- Category-wise Revenue Across Stores
- Revenue vs Profit Margin by Store

## Key Business Insights
- Identified top-performing stores based on revenue.
- Compared profitability across different retail locations.
- Analyzed category-wise revenue contribution.
- Evaluated conversion rates and customer purchasing behavior.
- Provided recommendations to improve store profitability and sales performance.

## Project Files
- Dataset: Source retail dataset.
- Dashboard: Power BI dashboard screenshot.
- PBIX File: Interactive Power BI report.

## Business Objective
To transform retail sales data into actionable insights that help improve revenue, profitability, store performance, and customer purchasing behavior.
